Domestic wire requests received through online banking are executed the same business day when submitted before 5:00 PM ET . International wire requests must be submitted before 3:00 PM ET . Requests received after the applicable cut-off are executed on the next business day.', ARRAY['Cut-off times']::text[], '## Cut-off times

Domestic wire requests received through online banking are executed the same business day when submitted before 5:00 PM ET . International wire requests must be submitted before 3:00 PM ET . Requests received after the applicable cut-off are executed on the next business day.

| Wire type | Channel | Cut-off (ET) |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Domestic | Online / mobile | 5:00 PM |
| Domestic | Branch | 4:00 PM |
| International | Online / mobile | 3:00 PM |
| International | Branch | 2:00 PM |', NULL, false, 73, '1.1.0', 'ba51829a-984b-4a7f-bab1-2d0bd7e2a435', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-22 23:33:05.000086+00:00', '2026-08-22 23:33:05.000086+00:00', false, '');
