Every mutating request must carry an Idempotency-Key header. Keys are retained for 24 hours . Resending an identical body with the same key returns the original response and does not create a second payment.', ARRAY['Base URLs', 'Idempotency']::text[], '## Idempotency

Every mutating request must carry an Idempotency-Key header. Keys are retained for 24 hours . Resending an identical body with the same key returns the original response and does not create a second payment.

curl -X POST https://api.example/v2/payments \ -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \ -H "Idempotency-Key: $(uuidgen)" \ -H ''Content-Type: application/json'' \ -d @payment.json', NULL, false, 55, '1.1.0', '6b0041db-a1a4-414a-9a29-6a911840aa7d', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 00:52:32.667870+00:00', '2026-08-23 00:52:32.667870+00:00', false, '');
