This control supports the bank''s obligations under the Bank Secrecy Act (BSA) and its Anti-Money Laundering (AML) programme. Transactions are monitored for patterns indicative of money laundering, and alerts are dispositioned within the required timeframe. A Suspicious Activity Report (SAR) is filed where the determination requires it.', ARRAY['Control objective']::text[], '## Control objective

This control supports the bank''s obligations under the Bank Secrecy Act (BSA) and its Anti-Money Laundering (AML) programme. Transactions are monitored for patterns indicative of money laundering, and alerts are dispositioned within the required timeframe. A Suspicious Activity Report (SAR) is filed where the determination requires it.', NULL, false, 89, '1.1.0', 'e323f1ad-80e5-4837-8772-51dd56a77ab0', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-22 23:35:32.551172+00:00', '2026-08-22 23:35:32.551172+00:00', false, '');
