The monthly service fee for Everyday Checking is $10 and is waived when any one of the following applies during the statement period: $500 or more in total qualifying direct deposits, a $500 minimum daily balance, or a primary account owner aged 17 to 24.', ARRAY['Purpose', 'Monthly service fee']::text[], '## Monthly service fee

The monthly service fee for Everyday Checking is $10 and is waived when any one of the following applies during the statement period: $500 or more in total qualifying direct deposits, a $500 minimum daily balance, or a primary account owner aged 17 to 24.', NULL, false, 69, '1.1.0', '9e0e5b41-8adb-4342-bce9-b51f3e29e71c', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-22 23:31:43.654475+00:00', '2026-08-22 23:31:43.654475+00:00', false, '');
