Sign on to Wells Fargo Online and access Manage Alerts . Select your debit card from the account list. Choose your alerts and delivery preferences – email, push notification, or text. You can add new alerts or change your notification preferences at your convenience.', ARRAY['Checking and Savings Help', 'You have questions, we have answers', 'How do I see what alerts are available and sign up for alerts for my card?']::text[], '### How do I see what alerts are available and sign up for alerts for my card?

Sign on to Wells Fargo Online and access Manage Alerts . Select your debit card from the account list. Choose your alerts and delivery preferences – email, push notification, or text. You can add new alerts or change your notification preferences at your convenience.', NULL, false, 86, '1.3.0', '7fca252d-7a91-4dad-8810-f9a833fdfe28', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-24 01:59:16.145233+00:00', '2026-08-24 01:59:16.145233+00:00', false, '');
