| 429 | rate_limited | The caller exceeded its quota for the window. | Retry after the interval in the `Retry-After` header. Do not retry sooner. |
| 503 | upstream_unavailable | A downstream rail is not accepting instructions. | Retry with exponential backoff and full jitter, up to the value-date deadline. |', ARRAY['Envelope', 'Codes']::text[], '## Codes

| HTTP | Code | Meaning | What to do |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 400 | invalid_request | The request body failed schema validation. | Fix the request. The `errors` array names each failing field. |
| 401 | unauthenticated | No credential, or the credential has expired. | Obtain a new token. Tokens live for 15 minutes. |
| 403 | insufficient_scope | The token is valid but lacks the required scope. | Request the scope named in `required_scope` at authorisation time. |
| 404 | not_found | The resource does not exist, or is not visible to this caller. | Do not retry. A 404 for an existing resource means the caller lacks visibility. |
| 409 | idempotency_conflict | The idempotency key was reused with a different body. | Use a fresh key, or resend the identical body to get the original response. |
| 422 | unprocessable | Well-formed but not actionable — a closed account, a past value date. | Correct the instruction. Retrying without change will fail identically. |
| 429 | rate_limited | The caller exceeded its quota for the window. | Retry after the interval in the `Retry-After` header. Do not retry sooner. |
| 503 | upstream_unavailable | A downstream rail is not accepting instructions. | Retry with exponential backoff and full jitter, up to the value-date deadline. |', NULL, true, 321, '1.1.0', 'f031602e-8002-42b4-a98d-297d67517618', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-22 23:32:40.836501+00:00', '2026-08-22 23:32:40.836501+00:00', false, '');
INSERT INTO "askcontent"."askcontent_document_chunk" ("connector_id", "document_id", "chunk_id", "ordinal", "text", "heading_path", "parent_text", "page", "is_table", "token_estimate", "chunker_version", "id", "org_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "is_code", "overlap") VALUES ('83359497-fae2-4de8-a660-cf4e969ab133', '6216129e-5389-4b90-85da-d78ab129773a', 'chk_4f20dd6d03ee4030', 4, '## Retries

Retry 429 and 503 only. Everything else is deterministic and will fail identically. Use exponential backoff with full jitter, and stop at the value-date deadline rather than at a retry count.', ARRAY['Envelope', 'Retries']::text[], '## Retries

Retry 429 and 503 only. Everything else is deterministic and will fail identically. Use exponential backoff with full jitter, and stop at the value-date deadline rather than at a retry count.', NULL, false, 50, '1.1.0', '45f7e6cc-8b97-4292-9544-7593435fe77e', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-22 23:32:40.836501+00:00', '2026-08-22 23:32:40.836501+00:00', false, '');
