- Creating or revoking a trust - Making or revoking a gift - Creating or changing survivorship interests - Creating or changing a beneficiary designation - Delegating authority granted under the power of attorney', 1, false, 93, '1.1.0', '864fc163-bf66-456d-a9a2-75c6372f69b6', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-22 23:32:59.160393+00:00', '2026-08-22 23:32:59.160393+00:00', false, '');
