Sign on to the Credit Card Service Center through Wells Fargo Online and select Request Balance Transfer under Account Management . Or call 1-800-642-4720 .

Read more about balance transfers .', ARRAY['Credit Card Help', 'Top Questions', 'How do I transfer a balance to my Wells Fargo card?']::text[], '### How do I transfer a balance to my Wells Fargo card?

Sign on to the Credit Card Service Center through Wells Fargo Online and select Request Balance Transfer under Account Management . Or call 1-800-642-4720 .

Read more about balance transfers .', NULL, false, 62, '1.3.0', 'd3d299c7-4285-4550-ac28-46b15b539100', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-24 01:59:16.145233+00:00', '2026-08-24 01:59:16.145233+00:00', false, '');
INSERT INTO "askcontent"."askcontent_document_chunk" ("connector_id", "document_id", "chunk_id", "ordinal", "text", "heading_path", "parent_text", "page", "is_table", "token_estimate", "chunker_version", "id", "org_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "is_code", "overlap") VALUES ('cba28334-247d-442a-bf39-8e6b4f466897', 'b146f531-d658-4200-828d-1c708a84a839', 'chk_a5d6beb591f798de', 5, '### What is Wells Fargo Rewards ® ?

Wells Fargo Rewards offers you a wide variety of ways to earn, use, and share rewards — from Travel to Gift Cards, and more.

With a Wells Fargo rewards-based credit card, you can earn rewards on virtually all purchases , including everyday items like groceries or gas, or on bigger items, like when you book travel, or stay at a hotel. Visit Wells Fargo Rewards to learn more.', ARRAY['Credit Card Help', 'Top Questions', 'What is Wells Fargo Rewards ® ?']::text[], '### What is Wells Fargo Rewards ® ?

Wells Fargo Rewards offers you a wide variety of ways to earn, use, and share rewards — from Travel to Gift Cards, and more.

With a Wells Fargo rewards-based credit card, you can earn rewards on virtually all purchases , including everyday items like groceries or gas, or on bigger items, like when you book travel, or stay at a hotel. Visit Wells Fargo Rewards to learn more.', NULL, false, 103, '1.3.0', '7f66a2bc-38ea-46db-8790-cf4fe604658e', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-24 01:59:16.145233+00:00', '2026-08-24 01:59:16.145233+00:00', false, '');
INSERT INTO "askcontent"."askcontent_document_chunk" ("connector_id", "document_id", "chunk_id", "ordinal", "text", "heading_path", "parent_text", "page", "is_table", "token_estimate", "chunker_version", "id", "org_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "is_code", "overlap") VALUES ('cba28334-247d-442a-bf39-8e6b4f466897', 'b146f531-d658-4200-828d-1c708a84a839', 'chk_61a2f093f5d5081e', 6, '### What should I do if I plan to travel and use my card?

Sign on to online banking and confirm your contact information is up to date so we can contact you if we detect unusual activity.

At this time, Wells Fargo cards cannot be used in Cuba or other sanctioned destinations as defined by U.S. Department of Treasury''s Office of Foreign Assets Control (OFAC). Please call the phone number on the back of your card if you have questions.', ARRAY['Credit Card Help', 'Top Questions', 'What should I do if I plan to travel and use my card?']::text[], '### What should I do if I plan to travel and use my card?

Sign on to online banking and confirm your contact information is up to date so we can contact you if we detect unusual activity.

At this time, Wells Fargo cards cannot be used in Cuba or other sanctioned destinations as defined by U.S. Department of Treasury''s Office of Foreign Assets Control (OFAC). Please call the phone number on the back of your card if you have questions.', NULL, false, 109, '1.3.0', '0668fc56-d99a-48f8-8682-539a0ba93f72', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-24 01:59:16.145233+00:00', '2026-08-24 01:59:16.145233+00:00', false, '');
