### Does Wells Fargo require a property inspection?

If you''re buying a home, it''s highly recommended that you obtain a property inspection and make your purchase offer contingent on the findings of the inspection.

There is a difference between a property inspection and an appraisal. An appraisal is required by most mortgage lenders in order to support the value of the real estate and the terms of the mortgage agreement.', ARRAY['Home Lending Help', 'Top Questions']::text[], '## Top Questions

