INSERT INTO "askcontent"."askcontent_document_chunk" ("connector_id", "document_id", "chunk_id", "ordinal", "text", "heading_path", "parent_text", "page", "is_table", "token_estimate", "chunker_version", "id", "org_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "is_code", "overlap") VALUES ('cba28334-247d-442a-bf39-8e6b4f466897', '6792a6d7-2a0b-4319-bd34-5f7ed047c449', 'chk_965dacca7b5fb3d7', 14, '## Information about vehicle repossession

If you don''t make the loan payments owed under your contract, we may repossess your vehicle. After repossession, you may need to pay to get the vehicle back or we may sell the vehicle to pay off your account. If you''re delinquent on your payments and concerned about possible repossession, call us as soon as possible.

If your account is past due, you may receive a letter from us with a requirement to strictly comply with the auto financing agreement that you signed. This letter lets you know what to do to bring your account current, and how to avoid repossession. If you have questions, call us right away so we can discuss options with you.

If your account is past due, you may receive a Right to Cure letter from us. This letter lets you know what to do in order to bring your account current – or how to "cure" the default and avoid repossession. If you have questions, call us right away so we can discuss options with you.', ARRAY['Auto loan FAQs', 'Information about vehicle repossession']::text[], '## Information about vehicle repossession

If you don''t make the loan payments owed under your contract, we may repossess your vehicle. After repossession, you may need to pay to get the vehicle back or we may sell the vehicle to pay off your account. If you''re delinquent on your payments and concerned about possible repossession, call us as soon as possible.

If your account is past due, you may receive a letter from us with a requirement to strictly comply with the auto financing agreement that you signed. This letter lets you know what to do to bring your account current, and how to avoid repossession. If you have questions, call us right away so we can discuss options with you.

If your account is past due, you may receive a Right to Cure letter from us. This letter lets you know what to do in order to bring your account current – or how to "cure" the default and avoid repossession. If you have questions, call us right away so we can discuss options with you.

If we repossess your vehicle, and you don''t redeem the vehicle or reinstate the account, we''ll sell the vehicle at auction and apply the amount we receive from the sale of the vehicle to the amount you owe us. If the proceeds from the sale aren''t enough to pay the full amount you owe us, you may be responsible for paying the remaining balance.

If we repossess your vehicle, there may be options to get it back. After repossession, we''ll send you a letter with specific details about your account. In some cases, you can "redeem" your vehicle by paying the full amount outstanding (plus repossession costs), or "reinstate" your account by paying the outstanding monthly payments (plus repossession costs). Each situation is different, and we want to help you. Please call us at 1-888-937-9992 , Monday – Thursday, 7 am to 7 pm, Friday, 7 am to 6 pm, and Saturday 7 am to 2 pm Central Time for more information.', NULL, false, 244, '1.3.0', 'aa89f627-b503-4f75-85ec-5f3ce4c9aa72', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-24 01:59:16.145233+00:00', '2026-08-24 01:59:16.145233+00:00', false, '');
