Contact the dealership or coverage provider to cancel the aftermarket product as they can best advise you on the cancellation process. In some cases, you may be required to complete a cancellation form or submit a written request to the dealer or coverage provider.

If you purchased Guaranteed Asset Protection (GAP), Credit Life Insurance, and/or Credit Accident & Health Insurance and would like to cancel any of these products, contact the dealership, or call us at 1-800-289-8004 , and we can start the cancellation process for you.

For a Guaranteed Asset Protection (GAP) product, we''ll issue a refund for any unused portion after the payoff of your loan. The refund processing time may take up to 120 days. Note: Some GAP products may not be eligible for a refund. Review your GAP contract to confirm eligibility.

For all other aftermarket products, contact the dealership or coverage provider to find out if you''re eligible for a refund. They’ll be able to provide more information about any potential refunds and timing.

The aftermarket product contract should state whether you''re entitled to a refund. If the contract doesn''t include this information, contact the dealership or your coverage provider to request it. If you need a copy of the aftermarket product contract, contact the dealership or call us at 1-800-289-8004 .

Contact the dealership or your coverage provider to request a quote for the refund. Factors such as aftermarket product type, purchase and cancellation dates, vehicle mileage at the time of purchase and cancellation, purchase price, and the state in which your loan originated can affect how the refund is calculated. To request a copy of the aftermarket product contract, contact the dealership or call us at 1-800-289-8004 .

Timing varies among types of aftermarket products, coverage providers, and states in which the loan originated. Contact the dealership or your coverage provider for more details. To request a copy of the aftermarket contract, contact the dealership or call us at 1-800-289-8004 .

The refund process varies based on the type of aftermarket product. The refund may be issued by us, the dealership, or the coverage provider. To find out who will issue your refund, call us at 1-800-289-8004 .

If your account balance is zero, we''ll send you a check.

If you have an account balance, we''ll apply a refund to your principal balance. Note: The refund won''t apply toward your monthly payment and won''t reduce your monthly payment amount. However, the refund to your principal balance may reduce the amount of interest you pay, and it may help you pay off your loan more quickly than the original term.

If your loan originated in the state of Nevada, we won''t apply the refund to your principal balance for non-GAP products. We''ll send you a check for the aftermarket product refund instead.

For products that can be canceled, if the dealer has been unresponsive to your cancellation request, has refused to cancel the product, or is out of business, call us at 1-800-289-8004 for assistance.', NULL, false, 307, '1.3.0', 'a5ed95b5-f3ab-4cbc-83db-2b57662caa97', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-24 01:59:16.145233+00:00', '2026-08-24 01:59:16.145233+00:00', false, 'and would like to cancel any of these products, contact the dealership, or call us at 1-800-289-8004 , and we can start the cancellation process for you.');
