Keeping your money and information safe is a top priority for Wells Fargo. When you use Zelle ® within our mobile app or online banking, your information is protected with the same technology we use to keep your Wells Fargo account safe.

If someone you blocked unenrolls from Zelle ® they’re removed from your blocked contacts list.

If they later re-enroll using the same email address or mobile number at the same bank, the block will automatically apply again and they’ll reappear on your blocked contacts list.

Zelle ® blocks are tied to how a contact is enrolled at their bank.

